## 📊 STEP SUMMARY TEMPLATE

```markdown
Goal: [цель шага]
Did: [действие] (diff N lines)
Result: OK/FAIL (метрика/вывод)
Next: [следующий шаг]
```

**Example:**
```markdown
Goal: Extract user data from parquet file
Did: Created extract_users.py (45 lines)
Result: OK (extracted 1,234 users, schema validated)
Next: Transform user data (add age_group field)
```

